Installation (for linux raspberry pi):
1.) python3 -m venv --system-site-packages [name of virtual environment] 
2.) cd ./path/to/venv/you/named
3.) source bin/activate
4.) cd ../
5.) pip install easyocr ultralytics opencv-python
6.) pip install --force-reinstall --no-cache-dir simplejpeg

If your camera is not plugged in you will get an index out of range python error!